#N canvas 40 40 620 260 12;
#X text 20 5 [atom-sq-text FIELD R G B] - writes one field of the SQ display: symbol or list of character codes. right inlet: new colour as R G B. fields: 0 2 4 top \, 6 middle \, 8 10 12 bottom \, +1 for the second line;
#X obj 20 60 inlet;
#X obj 20 90 route symbol;
#X obj 20 120 list fromsymbol;
#X obj 20 150 list prepend 240 0 1 6 34 18 \$1 \$2 \$3 \$4 0;
#X obj 20 180 list append 247;
#X obj 20 210 s sq-sysex;
#X obj 380 60 inlet;
#X obj 380 90 list prepend 240 0 1 6 34 18 \$1;
#X obj 380 120 list append 0;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 2 1 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 7 0 8 0;
#X connect 8 0 9 0;
#X connect 9 0 4 1;
